<title>USA: Covenant Transport names Joey Hogan CFO.</title>
<headline>Covenant Transport names Joey Hogan CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covenant Transport Inc said on Thursday that it named Joey Hogan its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Hogan replaces Bradley Moline, who left Covenant to take the same position at a telecommunications company.</p>
<p>Hogan comes to Covenant from a personal financial services company in Cleveland, Tenn., where he was chief financial officer, Covenant said in a news release.</p>
<p>Covenant is a long-haul truckload carrier.</p>
</text>
